  "body": "Found by the #926 per-post script suites (every recorded stream posted machine-less through `tormach-plasma.cps`).\n\nThe refusal reads: \"the Tormach 1300PL plasma post writes torch words (M200, G15, G16, M205) only a plasma table reads - no machine is not declared a plasma machine\". With no machine the name falls back to \"no machine\", which makes the sentence a double negative. Text only; the refusal itself is right.\n\nDone means: the machine-less wording reads as a sentence (e.g. \"... - no machine is stated, so none is declared a plasma machine\"), and the #926 `tormach-plasma` refusal goldens are regenerated with it.\n",
